# Analyze Learning Pack

This is an isolated pack-analysis runtime call. Analyze only the evidence packs listed in this turn, refine the pack-local candidates internally, and return only high-confidence repository knowledge that clears the admission bar. Precision is primary: source evidence alone does not justify a pattern, and later normalization cannot turn a weak candidate into useful knowledge.

